      <List Name="LanguageTexts" Type="System.Collections.ArrayList" />
    </Single>
    <Single Type="{53da1be7-ad25-47c3-b0e8-e26286dad2e0}" Method="IArchivable">
      <Single Name="TextID" Type="string">76</Single>
      <Single Name="TextDefault" Type="string">For testing purpose only!

Create an exception with the reaction TPL.ET_Reaction.MainsContactorOff.
Machine reacts with "Immediate deactivation of the mains contactor".
For a detailed description of this reaction search the help index for ET_Reaction.</Single>
      <List Name="LanguageTexts" Type="System.Collections.ArrayList" />
    </Single>
    <Single Type="{53da1be7-ad25-47c3-b0e8-e26286dad2e0}" Method="IArchivable">
      <Single Name="TextID" Type="string">74</Single>
      <Single Name="TextDefault" Type="string">For testing purpose only!

Create an exception with the reaction TPL.ET_Reaction.StopEndOfCycle.
Machine reacts with "Stop at end of cycle".
For a detailed description of this reaction search the help index for ET_Reaction.</Single>
      <List Name="LanguageTexts" Type="System.Collections.ArrayList" />
    </Single>
    <Single Type="{53da1be7-ad25-47c3-b0e8-e26286dad2e0}" Method="IArchivable">
      <Single Name="TextID" Type="string">68</Single>
      <Single Name="TextDefault" Type="string">For testing purpose only!

Create an exception with the reaction TPL.ET_Reaction.SyncStopEH.
Machine reacts with "Synchronous stop".
For a detailed description of this reaction search the help index for ET_Reaction.</Single>
      <List Name="LanguageTexts" Type="System.Collections.ArrayList" />
    </Single>
    <Single Type="{53da1be7-ad25-47c3-b0e8-e26286dad2e0}" Method="IArchivable">
      <Single Name="TextID" Type="string">72</Single>
      <Single Name="TextDefault" Type="string">For testing purpose only!

Create an exception with the reaction TPL.ET_Reaction.SyncStopEL.
Machine reacts with "Synchronous stop with process deactivation after stop".
For a detailed description of this reaction search the help index for ET_Reaction.</Single>
      <List Name="LanguageTexts" Type="System.Collections.ArrayList" />
    </Single>
    <Single Type="{53da1be7-ad25-47c3-b0e8-e26286dad2e0}" Method="IArchivable">
      <Single Name="TextID" Type="string">70</Single>
      <Single Name="TextDefault" Type="string">For testing purpose only! 

Create an exception with the reaction TPL.ET_Reaction.AsyncStop. 
Machine reacts with "Immediate asynchronous stop".
For a detailed description of this reaction search the help index for ET_Reaction.</Single>
      <List Name="LanguageTexts" Type="System.Collections.ArrayList" />
    </Single>
